<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>kritika · i write on Substack.</title>
<meta name="description" content="Kritika's Substack, VeryKritikal: essays on love, living alone, work, and the places that change her a little.">
